{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50008","headline":"因使日本愿谒鉴真和尚既灭度不觐尊颜嗟而述怀 · 高鹤林","name":"因使日本愿谒鉴真和尚既灭度不觐尊颜嗟而述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上方传佛灯，名僧号鉴真。\n怀藏通邻国，真如转付民。\n早嫌居五浊，寂灭离嚣尘。\n禅院从今古，青松遶塔新。\n斯法留千载，名记万年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高鹤林","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}